{
  "title": "TinyHouse",
  "children": [
    {
      "title": "Overview",
      "lines": [
        "3-osc wavetable",
        "synth. 8 voices",
        "poly or mono.",
        "",
        "3 wavetable oscs,",
        "sub, noise, multi-",
        "mode filter and",
        "two envelopes.",
        "",
        "Presets, modu-",
        "lation and knob",
        "mapping are all",
        "Schwung's own, from",
        "the slot settings.",
        "",
        "Based on Wavetable",
        "by Roland Rabien",
        "(FigBug), BSD-3."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Wavetables",
      "lines": [
        "Tables live in",
        "UserLibrary/",
        " Wavetables.",
        "",
        "Drop .wav files",
        "there via Move",
        "Manager or the",
        "schwung manager.",
        "",
        "Serum, Vital and",
        "Ableton exports",
        "work. Any frame",
        "size: 2048, 512,",
        "256, 128, or one",
        "single cycle.",
        "",
        "Frame size is read",
        "from the file's",
        "own harmonics, so",
        "short tables play",
        "at the right pitch",
        "with no metadata.",
        "",
        "115 factory tables",
        "are seeded on",
        "first run.",
        "",
        "On the OSC page,",
        "turn knobs 1/2 to",
        "step tables (OSC 3",
        "has its own), or",
        "click to browse",
        "with live preview."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Pages",
      "lines": [
        "Stock Schwung UI:",
        "jog scrolls, click",
        "opens, Back goes",
        "up. Knobs 1-8 play",
        "the open page.",
        "",
        "Presets: the list.",
        "Main: cutoff, res,",
        " env, decay, sub,",
        " width, space, bank",
        "Tone: the 3 waves",
        " drawn at their",
        " positions, attack,",
        " release, drive",
        "Macros: each one's",
        " name + a bar",
        "Effects: the chain",
        " EQ WID DLY REV,",
        " filled when on",
        "Mod FX: chorus,",
        " flanger, phaser",
        "Voice: voices,",
        " glide, bend range",
        "Grain 1-3: a sample",
        " slot. Its shape,",
        " the start point and",
        " scan direction,",
        " then the grain",
        " knobs and Kind",
        "Demo: play a song",
        "",
        "Everything else is",
        "on the web remote",
        "UI."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Unison + Sync",
      "lines": [
        "Unison goes to 16",
        "on every osc, from",
        "one shared budget",
        "of 64 oscillators.",
        "",
        "Voices divides it:",
        "8 voices share 8",
        "each, 4 share 16.",
        "Mono gets it all.",
        "Stacks shrink to",
        "fit, so lower",
        "Voices for wider",
        "chords.",
        "",
        "UCAP, the last dial",
        "on Main, limits every",
        "unison stack live.",
        "Clicking or glitchy?",
        "Turn it down, then",
        "Voices on the Voice",
        "page. Up = full.",
        "",
        "Filter Drive adds",
        "warmth and level",
        "and rounds off a",
        "ringing resonance.",
        "",
        "Sync on SHAPE adds",
        "a formant without",
        "moving the pitch.",
        "Point an envelope",
        "at it to sweep it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Space + EQ",
      "lines": [
        "The effects a preset",
        "carries: delay,",
        "reverb, width and a",
        "4-band EQ. They sit",
        "after the voices.",
        "",
        "SPACE, on the main",
        "page, scales delay",
        "and reverb together.",
        "100 is the preset",
        "as it was made.",
        "",
        "SPACE page: delay",
        "above, reverb below.",
        "SPACE 2: width, the",
        "right delay time,",
        "delay mode, low cuts.",
        "",
        "EQ 1, EQ 2: four",
        "bands. Type is Bell,",
        "a shelf or a cut.",
        "Gain does nothing",
        "on a cut."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Mod Envelopes",
      "lines": [
        "Env 2 holds two",
        "envelopes that go",
        "wherever you point",
        "them.",
        "",
        "On ENV MOD pick a",
        "destination for",
        "each and how much.",
        "",
        "WT Pos is the one",
        "to try: a decaying",
        "envelope there",
        "starts full and",
        "settles gentler,",
        "which is what",
        "makes a wavetable",
        "sound struck",
        "rather than held.",
        "",
        "Amount is bipolar.",
        "Centre is off; the",
        "lower half sweeps",
        "the other way.",
        "",
        "An LFO cannot do",
        "this shape: it",
        "repeats, and the",
        "point here is that",
        "it does not."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "MIDI",
      "lines": [
        "Notes, velocity,",
        "pitch bend (range",
        "on GLOBAL page),",
        "mod wheel (CC 1),",
        "sustain (CC 64),",
        "aftertouch.",
        "",
        "Mod wheel, after-",
        "touch and pitch",
        "bend are also mod",
        "matrix sources."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Demo",
      "lines": [
        "Play a part of a",
        "MIDI song on this",
        "slot. Bass on one",
        "slot, lead on",
        "another: switch",
        "them on to hear",
        "the whole track.",
        "",
        "Upload MIDI in the",
        "web remote UI:",
        "Demo tab > Import.",
        "",
        "Pages > Demo:",
        "Demo on/off,",
        "pack, part.",
        "",
        "Switching on does",
        "not start the",
        "transport: the part",
        "is ready and joins",
        "at the next bar once",
        "you press Play. It",
        "stops and starts",
        "with the transport.",
        "Parts of a song",
        "stay together.",
        "",
        "The slot remembers",
        "its song and whether",
        "Demo is on, and",
        "comes back to them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Macros",
      "lines": [
        "Imported Serum",
        "presets bring their",
        "macros: each knob",
        "on the Macros page",
        "moves what the",
        "preset routes to it",
        "(cutoff, effect",
        "mix, wavetable",
        "position...).",
        "",
        "The page shows each",
        "macro's name over a",
        "bar for its value.",
        "The web remote UI",
        "shows them too and",
        "the other tabs",
        "follow them.",
        "",
        "The sound at load",
        "is the preset's own;",
        "the knobs move",
        "from there.",
        "",
        "Sounds without",
        "macros ignore them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "title": "Credits",
      "lines": [
        "Sound engine after",
        "Wavetable + gin by",
        "Roland Rabien",
        "(BSD-3).",
        "",
        "Filter DSP:",
        "AudioFilter (MZTi).",
        "FLAC: dr_flac.",
        "Pink noise: Thomas",
        "Merchant (MIT).",
        "",
        "Wavetables:",
        "Adventure Kid",
        "(AKWF, public",
        "domain) and Neu",
        "KatalYst (free).",
        "",
        "Port for Schwung:",
        "athousanddetails."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
